{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfc;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#3b82f6;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);--shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.06);--radius:12px}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;color:#0f172a;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdff 0%, #fbfbfb 60%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:220px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#06b6d4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(59,130,246,0.08);color:var(--accent)}
    .primary-cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:34px auto;padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:22px}

    .hero{padding:26px 26px 18px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(59,130,246,0.04),transparent);}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px;color:#08112b}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .section-title{font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:700;margin:10px 0}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);background:linear-gradient(180deg,white, #fbfbfd)}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    button[type=submit]{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .price-card{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,white, #fcfeff);border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}
    .price-number{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#08112b}
    .toggler{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .switch{width:50px;height:28px;background:#e6eefb;border-radius:999px;position:relative;padding:4px;cursor:pointer}
    .knob{width:20px;height:20px;background:white;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(2,6,23,0.08);transition:transform 280ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .switch.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#06b6d4)}
    .switch.on .knob{transform:translateX(22px)}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood-grid{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);background:white;cursor:pointer}
    .mood.selected{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef2ff,white);border-color:rgba(59,130,246,0.18)}

    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}
    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:18px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .legal{background:linear-gradient(180deg,white, #fbfbfd);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Practice</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Q&A</a>
      <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
      <a class="primary-cta" href="contact.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="panel hero" aria-labelledby="connect-heading">
      <h1 id="connect-heading">Connect — practical clinical care with an ongoing membership option</h1>
      <p class="muted">If you’re reaching out for support, you’ll find a calm, structured approach that respects confidentiality and your time. Use this page to tell me what feels off, or to arrange a first conversation.</p>

      <div style="margin-top:18px">
        <div class="section-title">Mood-to-Method (quick diagnostic)</div>
        <div class="mood-grid" role="list" aria-label="Mood options">
          <button class="mood" data-method="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Short-cycle Stabilization&quot;,&quot;copy&quot;:&quot;When daily overwhelm narrows your options, short-cycle stabilization focuses on immediate, practical steps you can put in place this week.&quot;,&quot;ctaSuffix&quot;:&quot;Stabilize"}">Overwhelmed</button>
          <button class="mood" data-method="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Narrative Reframing&quot;,&quot;copy&quot;:&quot;When patterns feel stuck, we explore the stories that keep those patterns running and practice small experiments to shift them.&quot;,&quot;ctaSuffix&quot;:&quot;Explore&quot;}">Stuck</button>
          <button class="mood" data-method="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Rhythm Building&quot;,&quot;copy&quot;:&quot;If your days feel scattered, rhythm work helps create micro-routines that restore predictability and ease throughout the week.&quot;,&quot;ctaSuffix&quot;:&quot;Build Rhythm"}">Scattered</button>
          <button class="mood" data-method="{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Transition Support&quot;,&quot;copy&quot;:&quot;Life changes call for a mix of planning and emotional processing. We map the transition and steady the day-to-day tasks that matter most.&quot;,&quot;ctaSuffix&quot;:&quot;Plan Change"}">In transition</button>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,white,#fbfcff);border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div id="method-title" style="font-weight:800">Choose a state above</div>
              <div id="method-copy" class="muted">Selecting one of the options will surface a recommended clinical approach and adjust the message you can send when you reach out.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <a id="primary-cta" class="primary-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="panel">
      <div class="section-title">Send a note</div>
      <form id="contact-form">
        <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
          <label for="name">Your name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
          <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
          <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text">
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
          <label for="message">A brief note (what brought you here)</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A line or two helps me prepare for our first conversation"></textarea>
        </div>

        <input type="hidden" id="selected-method" name="selected_method" value="">

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
          <button type="submit">Send message</button>
          <div class="meta">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
        <div id="form-note" class="muted" style="margin-top:10px"></div>
      </form>

      <hr style="margin:16px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04)">

      <div class="section-title">Investment snapshot</div>
      <div style="margin-bottom:8px" class="muted">Toggle between simple monthly membership and an upfront package for focused work.</div>

      <div class="toggler">
        <div>Monthly</div>
        <div id="switch" class="switch" role="switch" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0"><div class="knob"></div></div>
        <div>Package</div>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing">
        <div class="price-card">
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Continuity Plan</div>
          <div class="price-number" data-monthly="75" data-package="780" id="price-membership">$75</div>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px">Monthly access to brief check-ins, resources, and weekly micro-practice reminders.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Focused Work Package</div>
          <div class="price-number" data-monthly="150" data-package="1200" id="price-package">$150</div>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px">A concentrated series of sessions for a defined goal (typically 6-10 sessions).</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Numbers animate to show the framing. You can reference either when you reach out.</div>

    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="legal">
      <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Confidentiality & boundaries</div>
      <div class="muted">Conversations are confidential except where required by law (e.g., risk of harm). I do not provide emergency services; if you are in crisis, call your local emergency number or contact crisis resources in your area. This site is for informational purposes and does not replace a clinical assessment or urgent care.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">By reaching out you acknowledge you are requesting information about services and not establishing a therapist-client relationship until an intake and agreement have been completed.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method selector
    (function(){
      const moods = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
      const title = document.getElementById('method-title');
      const copy = document.getElementById('method-copy');
      const selectedMethodInput = document.getElementById('selected-method');
      const cta = document.getElementById('primary-cta');
      const baseLabel = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
      cta.dataset.base = baseLabel;

      function setMethod(obj){
        title.textContent = obj.title;
        copy.textContent = obj.copy;
        selectedMethodInput.value = obj.title;
        // Update CTA to reflect selected focus while keeping placeholder
        cta.textContent = baseLabel + ' — ' + obj.ctaSuffix;
        // also subtly pulse the CTA to show change
        cta.animate([{transform:'scale(0.98)'},{transform:'scale(1)'}],{duration:220,iterations:1});
      }

      moods.forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          moods.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('selected'));
          btn.classList.add('selected');
          try{
            const parsed = JSON.parse(btn.getAttribute('data-method'));
            setMethod(parsed);
          }catch(e){console.error(e)}
        });
      });
    })();

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const switchEl = document.getElementById('switch');
      const membershipEl = document.getElementById('price-membership');
      const packageEl = document.getElementById('price-package');
      let on = false; // false = monthly, true = package

      function animateValue(el, start, end, duration){
        const startTime = performance.now();
        const step = (now)=>{
          const elapsed = now - startTime;
          const progress = Math.min(elapsed / duration, 1);
          const eased = progress<.5?4*progress*progress*progress:1 - Math.pow(-2*progress+2,3)/2; // ease in-out cubic
          const current = Math.round(start + (end-start) * eased);
          el.textContent = '$' + current;
          if(progress < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
        };
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }

      function updatePrices(toPackage){
        const mStart = parseInt(membershipEl.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || 0;
        const pStart = parseInt(packageEl.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || 0;
        const mTarget = parseInt(membershipEl.getAttribute(toPackage ? 'data-package' : 'data-monthly'));
        const pTarget = parseInt(packageEl.getAttribute(toPackage ? 'data-package' : 'data-monthly'));
        animateValue(membershipEl, mStart, mTarget, 420);
        animateValue(packageEl, pStart, pTarget, 420);
      }

      switchEl.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        on = !on;
        switchEl.classList.toggle('on', on);
        switchEl.setAttribute('aria-checked', String(on));
        updatePrices(on);
      });

      // keyboard accessibility
      switchEl.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{if(e.key==='Enter' || e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();switchEl.click();}});

      // initialize numbers based on monthly state
      updatePrices(false);
    })();

    // Form handling (local only)
    (function(){
      const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
      const note = document.getElementById('form-note');
      form.addEventListener('submit',(e)=>{
        e.preventDefault();
        // Collect values to show a brief confirmation. In production, replace with real submission.
        const data = new FormData(form);
        const preview = {}; data.forEach((v,k)=>preview[k]=v);
        note.textContent = 'Thanks — your message is ready to send. I will reply to ' + (preview.email || 'your email') + ' about next steps.';
        form.reset();
        // clear UI mood selection
        document.querySelectorAll('.mood.selected').forEach(n=>n.classList.remove('selected'));
        document.getElementById('method-title').textContent = 'Choose a state above';
        document.getElementById('method-copy').textContent = 'Selecting one of the options will surface a recommended clinical approach and adjust the message you can send when you reach out.';
        document.getElementById('primary-cta').textContent = document.getElementById('primary-cta').dataset.base;
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for private_practice_therapist site (chunk 4)

Files included:
- contact.html : The contact & interactive diagnostic page.

Purpose:
- Contact page is designed for a clinician-run private practice site. It includes a brief diagnostic "Mood-to-Method" selector and a simple "Pricing Comparator" toggle to show monthly vs package framing with animated numbers.
- The page uses placeholders for site-specific values that should be replaced during deployment or templating:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{TAGLINE}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

Local interactive features (no external services):
- Mood-to-Method selector: choose a mood tile to update the recommended approach (title, copy) and the CTA text. The CTA preserves the placeholder label and appends a short action hint (e.g., "{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — Stabilize").
- Pricing Comparator: a toggle switch between Monthly and Package. The displayed dollar amounts animate smoothly between values configured in data attributes on the price elements.

Important notes for deployment:
- This chunk references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for decorative background. Ensure that file exists and contains a suitable SVG pattern.
- No external fonts, CDNs, or images are required beyond the local pattern asset.

Content & legal guidance:
- The contact page includes confidentiality, scope boundaries, and a crisis notice. It avoids medical claims or guarantees and reads like a clinician-authored note.
- Replace placeholders with real practice details and phone/email before publishing.

How to test locally:
1. Place contact.html in the same folder as your site pages (index.html, about.html, etc.).
2. Create assets/img/pattern.svg (a simple repeating SVG pattern). The page references it as a background image.
3. Open contact.html in a browser. Interact with the mood tiles and the pricing switch. Submit the form to see the local confirmation behavior.

Accessibility & behavior:
- The mood tiles and the pricing switch are keyboard-accessible.
- The pricing animation uses requestAnimationFrame for smooth updates.

If you need an SVG pattern sample or additional pages for this template, request the next chunk containing assets or other HTML files."}
